  "definition": "Permit Modifications",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-03-21",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at part heading for Env-Wq 403) #9569, eff 10-17-09; ss by #12493, eff 3-21-18 (formerly Env-Wq 403.31) (See Revision Note #2 at part heading for Env-Wq 403)",
